Package: agentd
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Agent OS <agentos@agentos.example.org>
Depends: libc6, libsqlite3-0
Recommends: openssh-client, wireguard-tools
Suggests: ollama
Description: Agent OS core (agentd)
 User service: HTTP/WS API on a unix socket, the single writer of the
 sessions.db database, agent permissions and action log, search, scheduled
 tasks, encrypted backup and export.
 The package does not start the service itself and does not touch an
 existing DB; user data is kept on removal.
